{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2622\ufe0f100 Chernobyl Cats - Find 100 hidden cats in hand-drawn scenes of Chernobyl and Pripyat. \ud83c\udfed</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udc3eThis is a <strong>cozy</strong>, hand-drawn <strong>hidden-object</strong> game with no timers \u2014 just observation, <strong>zoom</strong> and gentle <strong>hints</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Look closer at <strong>Chernobyl</strong> and <strong>Pripyat</strong>. Relax, explore abandoned places and find \ud83d\udc08 100 hidden cats with  an <strong>atmospheric soundtrack for each location. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004300/extras/e7d85a387afbdef9dd71a1867d8a2ee7.avif?t=1762158721\" width=780 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udc08\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Can you find them all?\u00a0\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83d\udc08</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004300/extras/8de68553c6e741ace6536830d218761a.avif?t=1762158721\" width=780 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2699\ufe0f Key Features \u2699\ufe0f</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>2</strong> Levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc08 <strong>100</strong> Hidden Cats (on each level)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Atmospheric </strong>Soundtrack (for each level)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 High Quality Resolution Artworks (6K, 7K)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf17 Brightness Settings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcbe Auto-save</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d Zoom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude3a Real Meow Sounds!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 Combo Counter!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca1 Tips &amp; Hints</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf10 No Text In Game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004300/extras/5a11d669c62c0b639f3c57c397c8452d.avif?t=1762158721\" width=780 height=200 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4004300?t=1762158721","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004300/1655ca6eb3647648c9be0ce90f82754ade2c6ed6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762158721","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004300/9227f379b54544d208a4ecac42c9430db1613a7e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762158721","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004300/9227f379b54544d208a4ecac42c9430db1613a7e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762158721","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2622\ufe0f100 Chernobyl Cats - Find 100 hidden cats in hand-drawn scenes of Chernobyl and Pripyat. \ud83c\udfed</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udc3eThis is a <strong>cozy</strong>, hand-drawn <strong>hidden-object</strong> game with no timers \u2014 just observation, <strong>zoom</strong> and gentle <strong>hints</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Look closer at <strong>Chernobyl</strong> and <strong>Pripyat</